# Material that must never reach the public repository.
#
# `_private/` holds the Home Inn images that were once committed here: project
# photographs, superseded brand shots, and both sides of the visiting card. The
# back of that card carries the factory address, the hotline and a work email
# that is not public anywhere else, and the decision had already been taken not
# to publish it.
#
# `_config.yml` kept them out of the *built site*, but the repository itself is
# public, so every one of them was still downloadable from GitHub directly. A
# Jekyll exclude is not a privacy control. This is.
#
# The masters live in N:\Business\HomeInn. Put anything of the same kind here.
_private/
